s moved 5.8% year on year"]},{"headline":"Early signal: aircraft & spacecraft","detail":"Not a headline product yet, but growing 24% a year. Categories that hold that rate tend to reprice the market before they show up in the top ten, which is the window where entry is cheapest.","angle":"timing","strength":"watch","evidence":["Transport equipment — growing 24% a year since 2022, now 1.17% of imports at rank 17. Growth has been steady rather than a single spike."]}]','2026-09-04 20:08:50'),('res_833494657f664aef8e5e26','ent_china',NULL,'overview','{"year":2024,"export_usd":3576543293842,"import_usd":2585134598079,"balance_usd":991408695763,"total_trade_usd":6161677891921,"export_yoy_pct":5.82278526601244,"import_yoy_pct":1.1096679386261945,"export_concentration":0.10282016347371775,"partner_count":194,"product_count":97,"services_export_usd":346955325467.07,"services_import_usd":601934439615.8,"data_sources":["un-comtrade","world-bank"],"coverage_note":null}','2026-09-04 20:09:35');
