 15%/yr"]},{"headline":"United States, Hong Kong SAR, China, Viet Nam take 28% of exports","detail":"Export destinations are reasonably spread, which means established routes and documentation for several markets rather than just one.","angle":"partner","strength":"moderate","evidence":["United States: 14.9% ($525.6bn)","Hong Kong SAR, China: 8.3% ($290.9bn)","Viet Nam: 4.6% ($161.9bn)"]},{"headline":"Most imports arrive from Taiwan","detail":"Taiwan supplies 9% of what China imports. If you are sourcing to sell here, that is your incumbent competition and the price you have to beat. If you are buying, those trade lanes already exist.","angle":"partner","strength":"moderate","evidence":["Taiwan: 8.5% ($217.8bn)","Korea, Rep.: 7.1% ($181.5bn)","United States: 6.4% ($164.6bn)"]},{"headline":"2024 trade surplus of $991.4bn","detail":"China sells more than it buys. Surplus economies usually have foreign currency available, which makes getting paid and repatriating profit simpler.","angle":"risk","strength":"watch","evidence":["Exports $3576.5bn vs imports $2585.1bn in 2024","Exports moved 5.8% year on year"]},{"headline":"Early signal: tobacco","detail":"Not a headline product yet, but growing 135% a year. Categories that hold that rate tend to reprice the market before they show up in the top ten, which is the window where entry is cheapest.","angle":"timing","strength":"strong","evidence":["Agriculture & food — growing 135% a year since 2021, now 0.26% of exports at rank 45. Growth has been steady rather than a single spike."]}]','2026-09-04 20:09:35'),('res_990abf633aba45e483dd00','ent_ghana','run_66d136db7d6c4e448ec8af','overview','{"year":2025,"export_usd":31975161923.111,"import_usd":20166910856.186,"balance_usd":11808251066.925,"total_trade_usd":52142072779.297,"export_yoy_pct":54.88891413911926,"import_yoy_pct":15.043655830193128,"export_concentration":0.4268866677954134,"partner_count":188,"product_count":96,"services_export_usd":10059858835.321,"services_impor